      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Right now, the only way I know to do this is open up two copies of VRChat, one using your real account and one using a steam account. Have steam account add friend the normal account. Have normal account invite steam account into a world with him (adding sometimes takes a while or doesn't show up, so invite is easier). Since you are friends you have to click the avatar and say Use Safety Settings.\n\n(Also, I have 16GB and I still keep running out of memory by testing this way. If you have less than 16GB, having two copies of VRChat open is going to be really hard on your system.)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
