      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since advanced safety settings were implemented there is a huge problem with how custom avatars look with default shaders/animations/etc. Ability to see it would help to solve these issues.\nAlso there is a big problem with rendering one sided meshes with default shaders. All onesided meshes end up with holes in models.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "5c14b4459034f86e5b58c1ff",
      "author": {
        "_id": "59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5",
