      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5c14b4459034f86e5b58c1ff",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When using public avatars, it's not obvious how the avatar will look or behave when viewed by someone who has avatar features disabled. It would be helpful to be able to disable features on _your own_ avatar in order to preview how your avatar looks - or, for that matter, to voluntarily disable obnoxious sounds or particles on an otherwise nice public avatar that you're wearing.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Preview own avatar with features blocked",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5ba48feac9af0722d78a8434",
      "private": false,
